  "headline": "Indonesian Police Continue Investigation Into Illegal Wiretap Case",
  "seoTitle": "Indonesia Police Probe Illegal Wiretap Case",
  "metaDescription": "The Indonesian National Police confirm that no suspects have been named yet in the ongoing investigation regarding the illegal wiretapping of the President.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Chief of the Indonesian National Police stated that no formal suspects have been identified in the illegal wiretapping case.",
    "Investigators are currently examining potential involvement from parties beyond those previously identified in connection with the operation.",
    "Police leadership continues to coordinate with government officials regarding the status of the investigation and broader communication strategies."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police have intensified their investigation into the illegal wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto. While previous reports indicated that the police were examining the role of Jenderal Listyo Sigit Prabowo and a figure identified as TK, who holds the rank of Brigadier General, officials now clarify that no suspects have been formally charged. Authorities are currently exploring the possibility of other individuals or entities serving as end-users in the operation. Chief of National Police Jenderal Suyudi Ario Seto has held meetings with government stakeholders, including the Coordinating Minister for Political and Security Affairs, to discuss the ongoing inquiry and related issues such as hoax mitigation. The case remains a significant focus for the national law enforcement agency as they attempt to uncover the full extent of the unauthorized surveillance activity.",
